{"id":"728ff257684515d2","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-henkin-sentence-modal.md","title":"Henkin Sentence (Modal)","display":"df-henkin-sentence-modal — Henkin Sentence (Modal)","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-henkin-sentence-modal","aliases":["89-df-henkin-sentence-modal"],"display":"df-henkin-sentence-modal — Henkin Sentence (Modal)","depends_on":["[[89-df-fixed-point-modal]]","[[89-df-box-modality]]","[[89-df-gl-logic]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-henkin-sentence-modal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-henkin-sentence-modal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-henkin-sentence-modal — Henkin Sentence (Modal)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"02536e2efd437c59\" href=\"?note=02536e2efd437c59\" title=\"89-df-fixed-point-modal\">89-df-fixed-point-modal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d246470e97fec132\" href=\"?note=d246470e97fec132\" title=\"89-df-box-modality\">89-df-box-modality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(\\Box p,p)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(\\Box p,p)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> is the fixed-point set.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}henkin\\text{-}sentence\\text{-}modal}\\vdash\n\\mathcal{H}_{\\Box}\n\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(\\Box p,p).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}henkin\\text{-}sentence\\text{-}modal}\\vdash\n\\mathcal{H}_{\\Box}\n\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(\\Box p,p).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\\in\\mathcal{H}_{\\Box}\">\\(H\\in\\mathcal{H}_{\\Box}\\)</span> iff <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> is a GL fixed point of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box p\">\\(\\Box p\\)</span></li>\n<li>在相应的算术实现下，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H^*\">\\(H^*\\)</span> 与“<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H^*\">\\(H^*\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 中可证”可证等价。</li>\n<li>若该实现的证明谓词满足 Löb 条件，则 Löb 定理进一步给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash H^*\">\\(T\\vdash H^*\\)</span>；\n这项结论不是本定义的一部分。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-fixed-point-modal","status":"resolved","id":"02536e2efd437c59","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-fixed-point-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-box-modality","status":"resolved","id":"d246470e97fec132","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-box-modality]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-logic]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(